<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <title>Tashqariga — Master AI Image & Graphic Poster Prompt System</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: 'Segoe UI', Calibri, Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 11pt;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: #1E2322;
      background-color: #ffffff;
      padding: 30px;
    }
    h1 {
      color: #183B2B;
      font-size: 22pt;
      border-bottom: 3px solid #FF5E1E;
      padding-bottom: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }
    h2 {
      color: #183B2B;
      font-size: 15pt;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
      padding-bottom: 5px;
      margin-top: 25px;
    }
    h3 {
      color: #FF5E1E;
      font-size: 12pt;
      margin-top: 18px;
    }
    table {
      width: 100%;
      border-collapse: collapse;
      margin: 15px 0;
    }
    th, td {
      border: 1px solid #CBD5E1;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      text-align: left;
      font-size: 10pt;
    }
    th {
      background-color: #183B2B;
      color: #ffffff;
    }
    tr:nth-child(even) {
      background-color: #F8FAFC;
    }
    .badge {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 3px 8px;
      border-radius: 4px;
      font-weight: bold;
      color: white;
    }
    pre, code {
      background-color: #0F172A;
      color: #38BDF8;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-family: 'Consolas', 'Courier New', monospace;
      font-size: 9.5pt;
      white-space: pre-wrap;
      word-wrap: break-word;
      display: block;
      margin: 10px 0;
      border-left: 4px solid #FF5E1E;
    }
    .note-box {
      background-color: #F0FDF4;
      border-left: 4px solid #16A34A;
      padding: 10px 15px;
      margin: 15px 0;
      font-size: 10pt;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <h1>🏔️ TASHQARIGA — MASTER AI POSTER & PROMPT SYSTEM</h1>
  <p><strong>Brend:</strong> Tashqariga Outdoor & Travel Club<br>
  <strong>Uslub:</strong> Neo-Gorpcore, Modern Outdoor Editorial & Kinetic Community<br>
  <strong>Qo‘llab-quvvatlanuvchi AI:</strong> Midjourney (v6+), Google Imagen 3, DALL-E 3, Adobe Firefly, Stable Diffusion<br>
  <strong>Fayl turi:</strong> Mustaqil Universal Promptlar To‘plami (Universal Master Prompt Document)</p>

  <div class="note-box">
    <strong>💡 Qo‘llash bo‘yicha ko‘rsatma:</strong> Ushbu hujjatdagi promptlarni to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri istalgan neyrotarmoqqa (Midjourney, ChatGPT, DALL-E, Google Imagen) nusxalab tashlashingiz mumkin. Kvadrat qavs ichidagi <code>[MAVZU]</code>, <code>[LOKATSIYA]</code>, <code>[NARX]</code> kabi so‘zlar o‘rniga o‘zingizning turingiz ma'lumotlarini yozsangiz kifoya.
  </div>

  <h2>🎨 1. Rasmiy Ranglar Palitrasi (Official Color Palette)</h2>
